      "content": "\"stop the noise\"... that's all i want. i just want the noise to stop. but everything feels so heavy and pointless, and the idea of just... giving in to the emptiness... it almost sounds more peaceful than this constant, exhausting effort to pretend things matter. why is it so hard to just let go and accept that it's over?",
